f ARL8B sugeesting that ARL8B is a NatC substrate (PubMed:19398576)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}